[4.812833, "o", "E032 (error): principal moments break the triangle inequality\r\n\r\nFor any rigid body, the sum of two principal moments is at least the third. Violations mean the numbers cannot belong to any mass distribution, even if the matrix is positive definite.\r\n"]
